  "annotations": [
    {
      "id": "note-game",
      "page": "page-1",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -150,
      "w": 560,
      "text": "Three states of a hand.\nTable screen: the left readout carries Call Left and both point totals; only legal cards stay bright \u2014 tap one to lift it.\n\nBidding round 1 shows each call over the player's portrait. Round 2 pins the standing high call under the caller in red. Trump is kept by tapping a card in your own hand."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-felt",
      "page": "page-1",
      "x": 1500,
      "y": -150,
      "w": 390,
      "text": "Green baize on a dark wood rail with a dashed gold inner line \u2014 the one table finish, matching the build."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-meta",
      "page": "page-2",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1050,
      "w": 560,
      "text": "Meta screens share one chrome: 48px top inset, 16px gutter, 40px round-rect back button, kicker over a Cinzel title."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-system",
      "page": "page-3",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3250,
      "w": 620,
      "text": "Foundations, component anatomy, and motion. The motion tiles run at their real specified timings \u2014 the sheet is the spec, not a picture of it."
    }
  ],
